{"seq":2,"slug":"oxlint-overview","title":"OXC 与 oxlint 概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/oxlint-overview","wordCount":941,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"oxc-与-oxlint-概览\">OXC 与 oxlint 概览</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OXC（The JavaScript Oxidation Compiler）是一个用 Rust 编写的高性能 JavaScript/TypeScript 工具集合，其核心组件包括解析器（oxc-parser）、lint 工具（oxlint）、转译器（oxc-transform）和解析器（oxc-resolver）。oxlint 是其中最成熟的面向用户的工具，它的定位是<strong>ESLint 的高性能替代品</strong>，专注于代码质量检查而非格式化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[OXC 工具集] --&gt; B[oxc-parser&lt;br/&gt;解析器]&#10;    A --&gt; C[oxlint&lt;br/&gt;Lint 工具]&#10;    A --&gt; D[oxc-transform&lt;br/&gt;转译器]&#10;    A --&gt; E[oxc-resolver&lt;br/&gt;模块解析]&#10;    B --&gt; F[AST 输出]&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    F --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; G[诊断报告]&#10;    D --&gt; H[转译后代码]\">flowchart TD\n    A[OXC 工具集] --&gt; B[oxc-parser&lt;br/&gt;解析器]\n    A --&gt; C[oxlint&lt;br/&gt;Lint 工具]\n    A --&gt; D[oxc-transform&lt;br/&gt;转译器]\n    A --&gt; E[oxc-resolver&lt;br/&gt;模块解析]\n    B --&gt; F[AST 输出]\n    F --&gt; C\n    F --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; G[诊断报告]\n    D --&gt; H[转译后代码]</pre><p>oxlint 与 ESLint 和 Biome 的定位区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ESLint</th>\n<th>oxlint</th>\n<th>Biome</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现语言</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能范围</td>\n<td>Lint（+ 格式化插件）</td>\n<td>仅 Lint</td>\n<td>Lint + 格式化 + 排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插件系统</td>\n<td>完整插件生态</td>\n<td>无自定义插件</td>\n<td>有限扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则来源</td>\n<td>ESLint + 社区插件</td>\n<td>内置（移植自 ESLint）</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型感知规则</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>快 50-100 倍</td>\n<td>快 10-100 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置方式</td>\n<td>eslint.config.mjs</td>\n<td>oxlintrc.json / CLI 标志</td>\n<td>biome.json</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>oxlint 的核心策略是<strong>不求全面，但求极快</strong>。它将 ESLint 中最常用、最有价值的规则以 Rust 重新实现，作为 ESLint 的补充（而非完全替代）使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解析器架构与性能\">解析器架构与性能</h2><p>OXC 的解析器（oxc-parser）是整个工具集的基础，也是目前已知最快的 JavaScript/TypeScript 解析器之一。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OxcParserFeatures {&#10;  performance: {&#10;    speed: &#39;比 Babel Parser 快约 3 倍&#39;;&#10;    memory: &#39;内存占用仅为 Babel 的 1/4&#39;;&#10;    allocation: &#39;Arena 分配器减少 GC 压力&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  compatibility: {&#10;    estree: &#39;可输出 ESTree 兼容 AST&#39;;&#10;    typescript: &#39;原生支持 TypeScript 语法&#39;;&#10;    jsx: &#39;原生支持 JSX/TSX&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  errorRecovery: {&#10;    mode: &#39;容错解析&#39;;&#10;    behavior: &#39;语法错误后继续解析&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OxcParserFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  performance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    speed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '比 Babel Parser 快约 3 倍'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '内存占用仅为 Babel 的 1/4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    allocation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Arena 分配器减少 GC 压力'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  compatibility</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '可输出 ESTree 兼容 AST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    typescript</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '原生支持 TypeScript 语法'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    jsx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '原生支持 JSX/TSX'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  errorRecovery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '容错解析'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    behavior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '语法错误后继续解析'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>oxc-parser 的性能优势来自几个关键的架构决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Arena 分配器</td>\n<td>AST 节点在同一内存区域分配</td>\n<td>减少 90%+ 内存分配次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零拷贝字符串</td>\n<td>标识符直接引用源码片段</td>\n<td>避免字符串复制开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单遍解析</td>\n<td>一次遍历完成所有语法分析</td>\n<td>无回溯，线性时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内联优化</td>\n<td>关键路径的函数内联</td>\n<td>减少函数调用开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[源码文本] --&gt; B[Lexer 词法分析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Token 流]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Parser 语法分析]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Arena 分配的 AST]&#10;    E --&gt; F[零拷贝标识符]&#10;    E --&gt; G[精确位置信息]&#10;    E --&gt; H[类型注解节点]\">flowchart LR\n    A[源码文本] --&gt; B[Lexer 词法分析]\n    B --&gt; C[Token 流]\n    C --&gt; D[Parser 语法分析]\n    D --&gt; E[Arena 分配的 AST]\n    E --&gt; F[零拷贝标识符]\n    E --&gt; G[精确位置信息]\n    E --&gt; H[类型注解节点]</pre><p>解析器还支持输出 ESTree 兼容格式的 AST，这意味着理论上它可以作为 ESLint 的解析器后端使用，为现有 ESLint 规则提供更快的解析速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oxlint-规则与配置\">oxlint 规则与配置</h2><p>oxlint 内置了数百条规则，这些规则从 ESLint 核心规则和流行的社区插件中移植而来。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;./node_modules/oxlint/configuration_schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;no-unused-vars&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;    &quot;no-console&quot;: &quot;warn&quot;,&#10;    &quot;eqeqeq&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;    &quot;no-debugger&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;    &quot;prefer-const&quot;: &quot;error&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;plugins&quot;: [&quot;typescript&quot;, &quot;react&quot;, &quot;react-hooks&quot;, &quot;import&quot;, &quot;jest&quot;, &quot;unicorn&quot;, &quot;jsx-a11y&quot;],&#10;  &quot;ignorePatterns&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;node_modules/**&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./node_modules/oxlint/configuration_schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"no-unused-vars\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"no-console\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"eqeqeq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"no-debugger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prefer-const\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"typescript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"react-hooks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"jest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unicorn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"jsx-a11y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ignorePatterns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node_modules/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>oxlint 的规则涵盖了多个 ESLint 插件的核心规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const oxlintRuleSources = {&#10;  eslintCore: [&#39;no-unused-vars&#39;, &#39;no-undef&#39;, &#39;eqeqeq&#39;, &#39;no-debugger&#39;],&#10;  typescriptEslint: [&#39;no-explicit-any&#39;, &#39;no-non-null-assertion&#39;, &#39;consistent-type-imports&#39;],&#10;  reactPlugin: [&#39;jsx-no-target-blank&#39;, &#39;no-direct-mutation-state&#39;],&#10;  reactHooksPlugin: [&#39;rules-of-hooks&#39;, &#39;exhaustive-deps&#39;],&#10;  importPlugin: [&#39;no-cycle&#39;, &#39;no-self-import&#39;, &#39;no-duplicates&#39;],&#10;  unicornPlugin: [&#39;no-array-for-each&#39;, &#39;prefer-array-flat-map&#39;],&#10;  jestPlugin: [&#39;no-identical-title&#39;, &#39;valid-expect&#39;],&#10;  jsxA11yPlugin: [&#39;alt-text&#39;, &#39;aria-props&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oxlintRuleSources</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  eslintCore: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-unused-vars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-undef'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'eqeqeq'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-debugger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  typescriptEslint: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-explicit-any'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-non-null-assertion'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'consistent-type-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reactPlugin: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'jsx-no-target-blank'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-direct-mutation-state'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reactHooksPlugin: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rules-of-hooks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'exhaustive-deps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importPlugin: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-cycle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-self-import'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-duplicates'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unicornPlugin: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-array-for-each'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prefer-array-flat-map'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jestPlugin: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-identical-title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'valid-expect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  jsxA11yPlugin: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alt-text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aria-props'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CLI 使用方式简洁直接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"oxlint .                          # 使用默认规则检查&#10;oxlint --deny-warnings .         # 将 warning 视为 error&#10;oxlint -c oxlintrc.json .        # 使用配置文件&#10;oxlint --fix .                   # 自动修复&#10;oxlint -D correctness -D perf .  # 启用特定类别&#10;&#10;oxlint --ignore-pattern &quot;dist/**&quot; --ignore-pattern &quot;*.test.ts&quot; .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 使用默认规则检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --deny-warnings</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 将 warning 视为 error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> oxlintrc.json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 使用配置文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 自动修复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> correctness</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 启用特定类别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oxlint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ignore-pattern</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ignore-pattern</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.test.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-eslint-的互补使用\">与 ESLint 的互补使用</h2><p>oxlint 的官方推荐用法不是完全替代 ESLint，而是<strong>与 ESLint 互补</strong>——让 oxlint 处理那些不需要类型信息的高频规则，让 ESLint 处理需要类型信息和自定义插件的高级规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[代码检查需求] --&gt; B{规则类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|基础规则&lt;br/&gt;不需要类型信息| C[oxlint 处理]&#10;    B --&gt;|类型感知规则&lt;br/&gt;自定义规则| D[ESLint 处理]&#10;    C --&gt; E[50-100x 性能]&#10;    D --&gt; F[完整功能]&#10;    C --&gt; G[合并结果]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[统一诊断输出]\">flowchart TD\n    A[代码检查需求] --&gt; B{规则类型?}\n    B --&gt;|基础规则&lt;br/&gt;不需要类型信息| C[oxlint 处理]\n    B --&gt;|类型感知规则&lt;br/&gt;自定义规则| D[ESLint 处理]\n    C --&gt; E[50-100x 性能]\n    D --&gt; F[完整功能]\n    C --&gt; G[合并结果]\n    D --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[统一诊断输出]</pre><p>具体的分工策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>由 oxlint 负责</th>\n<th>由 ESLint 负责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>no-unused-vars</td>\n<td>@typescript-eslint/strict-boolean-expressions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eqeqeq</td>\n<td>@typescript-eslint/no-floating-promises</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>no-debugger</td>\n<td>自定义业务规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>react-hooks/rules-of-hooks</td>\n<td>需要 Type Checker 的规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>import/no-cycle</td>\n<td>eslint-plugin-boundaries</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 ESLint 配置中，使用 <code>eslint-plugin-oxlint</code> 自动关闭已由 oxlint 覆盖的规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import oxlint from &#39;eslint-plugin-oxlint&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [...tseslint.configs.recommendedTypeChecked, ...oxlint.configs[&#39;flat/recommended&#39;]];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oxlint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eslint-plugin-oxlint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tseslint.configs.recommendedTypeChecked, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oxlint.configs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'flat/recommended'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种分层策略在大型项目中效果显著：oxlint 在毫秒级完成基础检查，ESLint 只需处理剩余的高级规则，整体 lint 时间可缩短 60-80%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oxc-生态与未来方向\">OXC 生态与未来方向</h2><p>OXC 项目的野心不止于 lint，它的目标是成为<strong>JavaScript 工具的基础设施层</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const oxcEcosystem = {&#10;  released: {&#10;    &#39;oxc-parser&#39;: &#39;高性能 JS/TS 解析器&#39;,&#10;    oxlint: &#39;快速 Lint 工具&#39;,&#10;    &#39;oxc-resolver&#39;: &#39;Node.js 模块解析器&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  inProgress: {&#10;    &#39;oxc-transform&#39;: &#39;Babel 兼容转译器&#39;,&#10;    &#39;oxc-minifier&#39;: &#39;代码压缩器&#39;,&#10;    &#39;oxc-codegen&#39;: &#39;代码生成器&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  planned: {&#10;    &#39;oxc-type-checker&#39;: &#39;类型检查器&#39;,&#10;    &#39;oxc-formatter&#39;: &#39;代码格式化器&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oxcEcosystem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  released: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-parser'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'高性能 JS/TS 解析器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    oxlint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'快速 Lint 工具'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-resolver'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Node.js 模块解析器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inProgress: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-transform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Babel 兼容转译器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-minifier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'代码压缩器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-codegen'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'代码生成器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  planned: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-type-checker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'类型检查器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'oxc-formatter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'代码格式化器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OXC 与 Rolldown（Rust 实现的 Rollup 替代品，Vite 的未来打包器）紧密协作。Rolldown 使用 oxc-parser 作为其 JavaScript 解析器，这意味着 OXC 的解析器正在成为 Vite 生态的核心组件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>替代目标</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>oxc-parser</td>\n<td>Babel Parser / Acorn</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxlint</td>\n<td>ESLint（部分）</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxc-resolver</td>\n<td>enhanced-resolve</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxc-transform</td>\n<td>Babel</td>\n<td>开发中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>oxc-minifier</td>\n<td>Terser</td>\n<td>开发中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((OXC / oxlint))&#10;    解析器&#10;      Arena 分配器&#10;      零拷贝字符串&#10;      容错解析&#10;      ESTree 兼容&#10;    oxlint&#10;      300+ 内置规则&#10;      多插件规则移植&#10;      50-100x 性能&#10;    使用策略&#10;      与 ESLint 互补&#10;      oxlint 处理基础规则&#10;      ESLint 处理高级规则&#10;    OXC 生态&#10;      transform 转译&#10;      resolver 模块解析&#10;      Rolldown 集成&#10;    性能秘诀&#10;      Rust 系统级语言&#10;      单遍解析&#10;      零分配优化\">mindmap\n  root((OXC / oxlint))\n    解析器\n      Arena 分配器\n      零拷贝字符串\n      容错解析\n      ESTree 兼容\n    oxlint\n      300+ 内置规则\n      多插件规则移植\n      50-100x 性能\n    使用策略\n      与 ESLint 互补\n      oxlint 处理基础规则\n      ESLint 处理高级规则\n    OXC 生态\n      transform 转译\n      resolver 模块解析\n      Rolldown 集成\n    性能秘诀\n      Rust 系统级语言\n      单遍解析\n      零分配优化</pre><ul>\n<li>OXC 是用 Rust 构建的 JavaScript 工具基础设施，oxlint 是其面向用户的 lint 工具</li>\n<li>oxc-parser 通过 Arena 分配器和零拷贝策略实现了极高的解析性能</li>\n<li>oxlint 的推荐用法是与 ESLint 互补，而非完全替代</li>\n<li>通过 <code>eslint-plugin-oxlint</code> 自动关闭 ESLint 中已被 oxlint 覆盖的规则</li>\n<li>OXC 生态与 Rolldown/Vite 深度集成，正在成为 JavaScript 工具链的底层基础设施</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OXC 与 oxlint 概览","id":"oxc-与-oxlint-概览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"解析器架构与性能","id":"解析器架构与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"oxlint 规则与配置","id":"oxlint-规则与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"与 ESLint 的互补使用","id":"与-eslint-的互补使用"},{"level":2,"text":"OXC 生态与未来方向","id":"oxc-生态与未来方向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Biome 全面解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/biome-overview"},"next":{"title":"新一代工具横向对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/next-gen-tools/tool-comparison"}}